sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Хэрэглэгч
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Scraper as Scraper
    participant DB as Database

    User->>FE: Start Scraper
    FE->>API: POST /scraper/run
    API->>Scraper: Spawn background process
    Scraper->>DB: Insert data
    DB-->>Scraper: Success
    Scraper-->>API: Log write
    API-->>FE: 200 OK
